From e264cf9785dcfeb2aa6c2dc04d7f191860ef1490 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rvvm-ios port <port@rvvm-ios.local>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:58:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] net: tap_reinit and replayable port forwards; avoid
 thread_create macro clash on Darwin

Port tap_reinit() from the iOS fork. Port-forward rules are recorded so
they can be re-bound after the network stack is reset.

The thread_create macro in threading.h collided with the Mach
thread_create() declaration on Darwin. Callers now use rvvm_thread_create
directly.
